.009,0.014,0.01,0.009,0.007,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"The Bosun and the Monkey stop playing, as you gain their attention and prevent them from teaching any surrounding kids a scandalous new phrase to try in the playground.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":9.152,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":9.152,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"“Not bad, not bad. You could definitely use some lessons from Mr. Boots here, but it's a fine start. Do you know Good Ship Venus?\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":9.568,"end":19.072,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"large":{"start":9.568,"end":19.04,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You think of a word that rhymes with Venus and redirect him by inviting the Bosun, and Mr. Boots, to join your crew before you set sail.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.264,"end":27.16,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":27},"large":{"start":19.264,"end":27.328,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":27},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"I suppose I could join ya. After all, it's bad luck to sail without a bosun. Especially one who knows a verse or two. Shanties are full of wisdom don’t ya know! If it weren't for 'What Do We Do With A Drunken Sailor' how would anyone know what to do with a drunken sailor?\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.84,"end":42.656,"frac":0.927,"status":"ok","matched":51,"words":55},"large":{"start":27.84,"end":42.56,"frac":0.964,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":55},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"You nod politely and give him the location of your ship. As he walks off singing at the top of his lungs, you snap another picture for your pirate coat of arms. Clearly you’re one lucky son of a gun nabbing 2 crewmates in one hit, that luck needs to be reflected in your coat of arms.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":43.136,"end":59.232,"frac":0.877,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":57},"large":{"start":43.136,"end":59.232,"frac":0.965,"status":"ok","matched":55,"words":57},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92ae06f4d2_PC%20JM6_bosun.png"}